        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a plethora of foes - zombies, demons, vampires, aliens, mythological creatures...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last for as long as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are monsters everywhere, so be prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself as best you can, and take down your foes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you last the more chance you have of earning more powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords and axes are fine, but a gift from the gods can decimate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The  better armed you are the better your chances of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replenish health</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for long enough, and you'll be rewarded with a health boost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prolong the battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough, and you will be confronted by menacing Bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their only priority is your destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achieve a high score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you lasted long enough then you've achieved a new best score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to kill as many enemies as possible, to set a new best for the total number of enemies killed.</p>",
